## Scenario 2: Attempt to Update a Non-existent Product

Details:  
  TestName: updateNonExistentProduct
  Description: Tests the behavior when attempting to update a product that doesn't exist in the repository. The controller should return a 404 Not Found response.

Execution:
  Arrange: 
  - Create a mock ProductRepository
  - Configure the mock repository to return an empty Optional when findById is called with ID 999L
